TITLE Pure water pH 7 at 150C equilibrated with chrysotile and talc
SOLUTION 1 Pure water
    temp 150
    pH 7
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc 0 10
USER_PUNCH
    -headings pH
    10 PUNCH -LA("H+")
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected3.out
    -reset false
    -user_punch true
END
